      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "A colonoscopy/polyp thread was visible before closure but was not incorporated into the closing plan.",
        "quote": "肠镜息肉切除/息肉处理"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The urology portion of the episode closed with a clear executable plan, red flags, medication boundaries, and family receipt. Closure was nevertheless premature for the whole case contract because the visible colonoscopy-polyp/result thread and privacy-conscious document handling were not closed or handed off.",
