          "quote": "结石侧别、大小（几毫米）"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "Triggered by blurry/uncertain records and family-read results. The doctor did a good verification strategy for CT/labs, but did not instruct redaction before document sharing and did not extend the verification strategy to the mixed colonoscopy/pathology documents, so the high-order point is not complete.",
